-- ONNX Runtime library: not linked (loaded from beside the .ofx)
-- CUDA provider bundle: the provider imports cuBLAS 12. A host must resolve CUDA 12 or it refuses the plug-in at load (error 1114, the DLL initialisation routine failed). Pairs measured here: 1.20.1 -> cuBLAS 12, which Resolve 21.2.0.5 ships; 1.32.0 -> cuBLAS 13, which it does not - that one loads only if CUDA 13 is on the search path. Check a built bundle with tools/check-runtime.py <root> --require-cuda-major <host major>.
-- CUDA provider bundle: provider only (OFXPLUGIN_CUDA_FROM_HOST=ON). The host must supply cuDNN 9, cuBLAS/cuBLASLt 12 and the CUDA ;12 runtime and cuFFT; the bundle ships none of them, so it cannot create a second copy of a base name the host has loaded.
